# Udud OEM Edition - Redistribution License

The Udud Security Scanner is an advanced security orchestration framework and network auditing tool designed to analyze business logic vulnerabilities, system state transitions, and access control mechanics. Developed and maintained by Ayodya DSR, Udud provides deep diagnostic capabilities for complex modern environments.

Udud is free for individual end-users and independent security researchers. However, the standard public Udud Public Source License (UPSL) does not allow the redistribution or embedding of Udud within proprietary software products, commercial security scanners, or hardware appliances distributed to third parties. 

For organizations that want to embed Udud within their commercial products or deliver managed services without open-source restrictions, we offer the **Udud Commercial & OEM License (UCOL)**. This program provides the legal rights, custom software builds, and technical backing necessary for commercial distribution.

